# Rendered by the daemon from the plugin config (install / reconfigure) and sourced by the camera
# init scripts. WEBRTC_ENABLED gates the second (H264/WebRTC) encoder; CAMERA_RESOLUTION sets the
# built-in (MIPI) capture resolution. WEBRTC_SESSION_TIMEOUT_MIN recycles each WebRTC viewer after
# that many minutes (0 = off); a memory-safety backstop, off by default.
WEBRTC_ENABLED=$WEBRTC_ENABLED
CAMERA_RESOLUTION=$CAMERA_RESOLUTION
WEBRTC_SESSION_TIMEOUT_MIN=$WEBRTC_SESSION_TIMEOUT_MIN
